{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epstein </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TICKET TO THE ISLAND EXPIRED: TARGET EPSTEIN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is clear: Infiltrate the depths of this mysterious island and hunt down the &quot;familiar&quot; urban legends (Ball Gates, Danold Tramp, Leo Cabrio, and Havking) guarding each region. Combine the secret files they drop to craft your VIP Invite and face EPSTEIN himself in the heart of the manor. This is the ultimate survival and execution operation against the shadowy figures of a dark fictional lore!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf THE HUNT LIST: COLLECT FILES, CLEAR THE PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach the final truth, you must first take down the &quot;guardians&quot; of the island. Each region awaits you with its own boss and unique challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The North:</strong> Enter the territories of <strong>Leo Cabrio</strong> and <strong>Ball Gates</strong> to seize the first file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The South:</strong> Face off against <strong>Tom Hanx</strong> and <strong>MJ</strong> to bag the second file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The East:</strong> Infiltrate the domains of <strong>Danold Tramp</strong> and <strong>AloneMask</strong> for the third file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The West:</strong> Solve the secrets of <strong>Havking</strong> and <strong>Pitza Gate</strong> to reach the final file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CENTRAL:</strong> Combine all 4 files, craft your <strong>VIP Invite</strong>, and settle the score with <strong>EPSTEIN</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786830/extras/49a8a3a75e73e58bf7eea10ca7265e9c.avif?t=1771598624\" widt